{% comment %}
  SUAVELAND · CLOUD SOCKS · BENEFICIOS PREMIUM (3)
  Para el bloque "Liquid personalizado" de la página de producto.
  Íconos blancos de línea fina dentro de un círculo azul marino. Hereda las fuentes del theme.
{% endcomment %}

<ul class="sl-benefits" role="list">

  <li class="sl-benefits__item">
    <span class="sl-benefits__icon" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 16v-2.38C4 11.5 2.97 10.5 3 8c.03-2.72 1.49-6 4.5-6C9.37 2 10 3.8 10 5.5c0 3.11-2 5.66-2 8.68V16a2 2 0 1 1-4 0Z"/><path d="M20 20v-2.38c0-2.12 1.03-3.12 1-5.62-.03-2.72-1.49-6-4.5-6C14.63 6 14 7.8 14 9.5c0 3.11 2 5.66 2 8.68V20a2 2 0 1 0 4 0Z"/><path d="M16 17h4"/><path d="M4 13h4"/></svg>
    </span>
    <div class="sl-benefits__copy">
      <span class="sl-benefits__title">Chau dedos apretados</span>
      <span class="sl-benefits__desc">Punta ancha: más lugar para tus dedos, sin presión ni ampollas.</span>
    </div>
  </li>

  <li class="sl-benefits__item">
    <span class="sl-benefits__icon" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12.67 19a2 2 0 0 0 1.416-.588l6.154-6.172a6 6 0 0 0-8.49-8.49L5.586 9.914A2 2 0 0 0 5 11.328V18a1 1 0 0 0 1 1z"/><path d="M16 8 2 22"/><path d="M17.5 15H9"/></svg>
    </span>
    <div class="sl-benefits__copy">
      <span class="sl-benefits__title">Llegás a la noche sin dolor de pies</span>
      <span class="sl-benefits__desc">Suavidad tipo nube en cada paso, todo el día.</span>
    </div>
  </li>

  <li class="sl-benefits__item">
    <span class="sl-benefits__icon" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M10 3.5s-5.5 6-5.5 10.2a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 11 0C15.5 9.5 10 3.5 10 3.5z"/><path d="M7.6 14.2a2.4 2.4 0 0 0 2.4 2.4"/><path d="M18.5 3v3.5M16.75 4.75h3.5"/><path d="M20 10v2M19 11h2"/></svg>
    </span>
    <div class="sl-benefits__copy">
      <span class="sl-benefits__title">Secos, frescos y sin olor</span>
      <span class="sl-benefits__desc">Absorben la transpiración y frenan el olor.</span>
    </div>
  </li>

</ul>

<style>
  .sl-benefits { width: 100%; margin: 8px 0 14px; padding: 0; list-style: none;
    font-family: var(--font-body-family, inherit); color: #111111; }
  .sl-benefits, .sl-benefits * { box-sizing: border-box; }

  .sl-benefits__item { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; margin: 0; padding: 12px 0;
    list-style: none; border-top: 1px solid rgba(17,17,17,.07); }
  .sl-benefits__item:first-child { border-top: 0; padding-top: 2px; }
  .sl-benefits__item:last-child { padding-bottom: 0; }
  .sl-benefits__item::before, .sl-benefits__item::marker { content: none; display: none; }

  /* ÍCONO: círculo azul marino + línea blanca */
  .sl-benefits__icon { flex: 0 0 42px; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 30% 25%, #2A3B60 0%, #1B2A4A 70%);
    box-shadow: 0 6px 14px -8px rgba(27,42,74,.6), inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.08);
    color: #FFFFFF; }
  .sl-benefits__icon svg { display: block; width: 20px; height: 20px;
    fill: none; stroke: currentColor; stroke-width: 1.5; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }

  /* TEXTO */
  .sl-benefits__copy { flex: 1 1 auto; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; }
  .sl-benefits__title { display: block; font-family: var(--font-heading-family, inherit);
    font-weight: var(--font-heading-weight, 600); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.3;
    letter-spacing: -.01em; color: #111111; }
  .sl-benefits__desc { display: block; font-family: var(--font-body-family, inherit);
    font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.4; color: rgba(17,17,17,.6); }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .sl-benefits { margin: 6px 0 12px; }
    .sl-benefits__item { gap: 12px; padding: 10px 0; }
    .sl-benefits__icon { flex-basis: 38px; width: 38px; height: 38px; }
    .sl-benefits__icon svg { width: 18px; height: 18px; }
    .sl-benefits__title { font-size: 14.5px; }
    .sl-benefits__desc { font-size: 13px; }
  }
</style>
